    Key Directory On/Off\n  o\tToggle Orbit Lines On/Off\n  r\tToggle Range to Target
    Display On/Off\n  t\tToggle Sim Time Elapsed/Mission Time\n  v\tToggle VizMessage
    Panel On/Off\n\nMain Camera Keyboard Controls:\n  l/L\t\tToggle Flashlight On/Off\n 
    [ / ]\t\tZoom In/Out\n  \u2191 / \u2193\t\tPitch Up/Down\n\u2190/\u2192\t\tYaw
    Left/Right\n  </>\t\tRoll Counterclockwise/Clockwise\n  s\t\tStop All Camera
